---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Disclaimer - Bijli Gyaan | Important Safety & Legal Notice"
  description="Bijli Gyaan (bijligyaan.in) ka Disclaimer. Electrical safety warning, educational guidance, DISCOM solar rules aur affiliate disclosures ki zaroori jankari."
>
  <main class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-10 text-slate-200">
    
    <!-- Header Card -->
    <div class="bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-3xl p-6 md:p-10 shadow-2xl mb-8 relative overflow-hidden">
      <div class="absolute -right-16 -top-16 w-52 h-52 bg-amber-500/10 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>
      
      <span class="text-xs font-bold text-amber-400 uppercase tracking-wider bg-amber-400/10 px-3 py-1 rounded-md border border-amber-400/20">
        Legal Disclaimer & Safety Notice
      </span>
      <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold text-white mt-3">
        Disclaimer
      </h1>
      <p class="text-slate-400 text-xs md:text-sm mt-2">
        Last Updated: October 2026 • Bijli Gyaan (https://www.bijligyaan.in/)
      </p>
      
      <p class="text-slate-300 text-sm md:text-base mt-4 leading-relaxed">
        Agar aapko hamari website <strong>Bijli Gyaan</strong> par di gayi kisi bhi jaankari, load formula, ya solar calculation ko lekar koi sawaal ya sandeh hai, toh aap be-jhijhak hamare <a href="/contact" class="text-amber-400 underline font-semibold">Contact Us</a> page par jaakar humse sampark kar sakte hain.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Prominent Safety Warning Card (Fixed High-Contrast Solid Theme) -->
    <div class="bg-slate-900 border-2 border-red-500/70 rounded-3xl p-6 md:p-8 shadow-xl mb-8">
      <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
        <div class="text-3xl md:text-4xl shrink-0">⚠️</div>
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-red-400 mb-2">
            Zaroori Suraksha Chetwani (High Voltage Safety Warning)
          </h2>
          <p class="text-slate-200 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed">
            Bijli (Electricity) ka kaam atyadhik khatarnak aur jaanleva (fatal) ho sakta hai. Galat wire connection, bina fuse/MCB ka prayog ya live wires par bina proper personal protective equipment (PPE kit) ke kaam karne se severe electric shock, aag (fire hazard) aur bhari aarthik nuksan ho sakta hai.
          </p>
          <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1.5 text-slate-300 text-sm mt-3 font-medium">
            <li>Bina certified electrical qualification ke koi bhi technical modification khud try na karein.</li>
            <li>Hamesha sarkari authorized certified electrician ya official DISCOM technician ki madad lein.</li>
            <li>Bijli Gyaan par uplabdh content padhkar kiye gaye kisi bhi personal experiment ya accident ke liye website ya iske authors zimmedar nahi honge. Har user apni suraksha ka swayam zimmedar hai.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Main Disclaimer Clauses -->
    <div class="bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-3xl p-6 md:p-10 space-y-8 shadow-xl text-slate-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed">
      
      <!-- 1. Educational Purpose Only -->
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3 flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="text-amber-400">1.</span> Sirf Jaankari Aur Jagrukta Ke Liye (Educational Purpose Only)
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-3">
          Bijli Gyaan par hum jo bhi articles, calculators aur guides publish karte hain—chahe wo <strong>Smart Meter</strong> ho, <strong>PM Surya Ghar Solar Yojana</strong>, <strong>MCB/RCCB sizing</strong> ho ya <strong>Home Wiring Load Calculation</strong>—wo sirf general knowledge aur user awareness badhane ke uddeshya se likhe gaye hain.
        </p>
        <p>
          Hum poori koshish karte hain ki saari jankari field-verified aur updated ho. Lekin har state ke DISCOM regulations, state electricity board rules, aur ground wiring condition alag-alag ho sakti hain. Isliye koi bhi final decision lene se pehle apne local electrical inspector ya licensed professional se verify zaroor karein.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- 2. External Links Disclaimer -->
      <section class="border-t border-slate-800 pt-6">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3 flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="text-amber-400">2.</span> Bahari Links (External Links Disclaimer)
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-3">
          Hamari website par aapko zaroori sarkari portals (jaise PM Surya Ghar Portal, State DISCOM Websites, Central Electricity Authority standards) ke direct hyperlinks mil sakte hain.
        </p>
        <p>
          Hum sirf vishwasniya aur authentic resources ko hi link karte hain. Halanki, un external websites par uplabdh badalte hue content, policies ya service terms par hamara koi direct niyantran nahi hota. Kisi bhi third-party portal ka upyog karne se pehle unki policy zaroor check karein.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- 3. Affiliate Disclosure -->
      <section class="border-t border-slate-800 pt-6">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3 flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="text-amber-400">3.</span> Affiliate Disclosure (Commercial Transparency)
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-3">
          Bijli Gyaan par transparency hamari sabse badi policy hai. Hamare kuch articles mein reliable electrical tools (jaise Digital Multimeter, Wire Stripper, Megger Meter, Solar accessories) ke affiliate referral links shamil ho sakte hain.
        </p>
        <div class="bg-amber-400/10 border border-amber-400/30 rounded-xl p-4 text-xs md:text-sm text-slate-300">
          <strong>FTC & Affiliate Rule:</strong> Agar aap hamare diye gaye affiliate link ke jariye koi tool ya equipment purchase karte hain, toh hume bina kisi extra cost ke ek chhota referral commission milta hai. Isse product ki actual MRP ya discount price par aapke liye koi asar nahi padta.
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- 4. User Consent -->
      <section class="border-t border-slate-800 pt-6">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3 flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="text-amber-400">4.</span> Sahmati (User Consent)
        </h2>
        <p>
          Hamari website (<a href="https://www.bijligyaan.in/" class="text-amber-400 hover:underline">bijligyaan.in</a>) ka upyog karke aap hamare is Disclaimer ko poori tarah samajhte hain aur iske sabhi niyam-sharton se apni poorna sahmati vyakt karte hain.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Contact Section Inside Disclaimer -->
      <div class="border-t border-slate-800 pt-6 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start sm:items-center justify-between gap-4">
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-white font-bold text-base">Legal Queries?</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-400 text-xs mt-1">
            Kisi bhi technical doubt ya correction ke liye contact karein:
          </p>
        </div>
        <a 
          href="mailto:officialpramod91@gmail.com" 
          class="bg-amber-400 text-slate-950 font-bold px-4 py-2 rounded-xl text-xs hover:bg-amber-300 transition-colors shrink-0"
        >
          ✉ officialpramod91@gmail.com
        </a>
      </div>

    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>